{"id":"blatt","lemma":"Blatt","pos":"noun","rank":2982,"glosses":["leaf (green and flat organ of a plant)","petal (one of the parts of the whorl of a flower)","sheet, piece of paper (piece of paper (usually rectangular) that has not been cut, torn, or folded)"],"ipa":"/blat/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/79/De-Blatt.ogg/De-Blatt.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Blattes","plural":"Blätter"},"examples":[{"text":"Ein Blatt fällt.","en":"A leaf is falling.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to fall, to drop","l":"fallen"}]},{"text":"Warum sind Blätter grün?","en":"Why are leaves green?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"green"}]},{"text":"Ich bekam ein gutes Blatt.","en":"I was dealt a good hand.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566604","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to receive","l":"bekommen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Jetzt fallen die Blätter.","en":"The leaves are now falling.","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"to fall, to drop"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Bring mir bitte ein Blatt Papier.","en":"Bring me a sheet of paper, please.","words":[{"g":"to bring","l":"bringen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"please"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"paper"}]}]}